          "optional": true,
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Accessible name for the mobile navigation Sheet. Native aria-label takes precedence;\ntitle is used when neither native aria-label nor this prop is provided.\nLocalized via MoraineProvider messages when omitted. English default is `Sidebar navigation`."
